<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Grand Opening Invitation</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;

            /* Blue + Green Background */
            background: linear-gradient(
                135deg,
                #0066cc,
                #00a86b,
                #00c878,
                #005bea
            );

            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 30px;
        }

        .invitation {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 650px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
            padding: 40px 30px;
            border-radius: 25px;

            box-shadow:
                0 15px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);

            text-align: center;
        }

        .top-icon {
            font-size: 45px;
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 10px 0;
            color: #0066cc;
            font-size: 38px;
        }

        .welcome {
            color: #444;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .shop {
            margin: 20px 0;
            padding: 15px;

            font-size: 30px;
            font-weight: bold;

            color: white;
            background: linear-gradient(
                90deg,
                #0066cc,
                #00a86b
            );

            border-radius: 15px;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #008f5a;
        }

        .details {
            margin-top: 25px;
            padding: 20px;

            background: #eefcff;
            border-left: 6px solid #00a86b;
            border-radius: 12px;

            font-size: 19px;
            line-height: 2;
            color: #222;
        }

        .message {
            margin-top: 25px;
            color: #075985;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 25px;
            color: #555;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        /* Mobile Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 600px) {

            body {
                padding: 15px;
            }

            .invitation {
                padding: 30px 18px;
            }

            h1 {
                font-size: 30px;
            }

            .shop {
                font-size: 24px;
            }

            .details {
                font-size: 17px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="invitation">

        <div class="top-icon">⚡</div>

        <h1>GRAND OPENING</h1>

        <p class="welcome">
            You are cordially invited to the grand opening of
        </p>

        <div class="shop">
            [SHOP NAME]
        </div>

        <h2>Electrical & Electronics</h2>

        <div class="details">

            📅 <b>Date:</b> [DATE] <br>

            ⏰ <b>Time:</b> [TIME] <br>

            👤 <b>Owner:</b> [OWNER'S NAME] <br>

            📍 <b>Place:</b> [SHOP ADDRESS]

        </div>

        <div class="message">
            🙏 Your Presence Makes Our Day Special 🙏
        </div>

        <p class="footer">
            Please join us and bless us on this special occasion.
        </p>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
